 scene it's just  surreal  the resulting beatdown is probably not  the best anime fight ever but when it  comes to evoking emotions this is one of  the examples that showcase what peak  anime could be  this is truly an amazing moment that  furthers gone's character development  and gave us a scene to remember while  doing it it's not every day that you can  see the role of hero and villain look as  if they swapped for the first time and  look so powerful  for that this moment tops our list  that's it for our list today the top 10  moments that just feel satisfying and  gratifying in anime  what about you what moments gave you  that adrenaline rush out of fulfillment  i'd love to hear your thoughts so make  sure to take your time to type your  comments down below before leaving  don't forget to hit both the like and  the subscribe buttons also feel free to  check out my patreon if you have time as  well i'll surely be able to take this  channel to new heights  and give you even more anime content in  the days to come i've left a link below  so come drop by if you'd like to support  the channel this will have to do it for  now and i'll be seeing you next time  thanks for watching  and hope to see you again soon  [Music]  you

